      "image": "https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/d1/4e/669328_YvjkK.jpg",
      "summary": "It’s December 31st, 1999. As the Devil’s daughter, you’ve been dared to stop your dad’s plan to take over the world before midnight. Solve wacky problems, collect bizarre items, and choose carefully—your decisions shape the ending!\r\n\r\nIt’s the night before Y2K, and your dad—the Devil himself—has a plan to rule the world. Unfortunately for him, you’ve been challenged to stop it. Armed with sarcasm, questionable decision-making, and whatever weird items you can scrounge up, you’ll navigate a cast of chaotic characters, each with their own ridiculous problems to solve.\r\n\r\nTime is of the essence - Every minute in real time is a minute in the game. It's a good thing skateboarding is faster than walking! You start at 8AM and have until Midnight to save the world... but DON'T PANIC! There are rumors of a time traveler with experimental... \"methods\" who may be able to help.\r\n\r\nMinimal guiderails - Coming up with a plan to save the world isn't easy, but through exploring the open world, talking to people, and collecting various items, the path to salvation may start to unfurl before you. But be careful! Your choices matter, choose wisely or you may end up with a fate you deserve...\r\n\r\nWill the Devil Prevail? Will the World End? Fate is in YOUR hands now...",
