      },
      "image": "https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/9b/6a/681276_RoJZr.jpg",
      "summary": "100 mommies. 100 ways to die. Only one survives. A psychological horror visual novel where your choices determine who lives and who dies in a twisted underground facility.\r\n\r\nA Psychological Horror Visual Novel\r\n\r\nYou wake up in \"The Nursery\" - an underground research facility with no memory of how you got there. 100 women claim to be your \"mommy\" - each one desperate, obsessive, and convinced YOU belong to HER.\r\n\r\nA distorted AI voice announces the rules: **Only one mommy can leave alive.**\r\n\r\nYou must choose who eats, who sleeps, who gets medicine. Every choice starves, poisons, or condemns another. They'll do ANYTHING to survive - manipulate you, betray each other, kill when you're not looking.\r\n\r\nThe twist? One of them might actually be your real mother. You'll never know which one you sent to the incinerator.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n\r\n- **100 Unique Mommies** - Each with distinct personalities, psychological profiles, and survival strategies\r\n\r\n- **100 Ways to Die** - Brutal, varied death scenes based on your choices\r\n\r\n- **Psychological Horror** - Gaslighting, manipulation, guilt, and mind-breaking choices\r\n\r\n- **Choice-Based Survival** - Your decisions determine who lives and who dies\r\n\r\n- **Multiple Endings** - The final survivor reflects your playstyle\r\n\r\n## Content Warning\r\n\r\nThis game contains:\r\n\r\n- Graphic violence and death scenes\r\n\r\n- Psychological horror and manipulation\r\n\r\n- Disturbing themes and imagery\r\n\r\n- Mature content\r\n\r\n**Not suitable for children or those sensitive to psychological horror.**",
